  "name": "Transport Committee",
  "parent_committee_id": null,
  "purpose": "<p>The Transport Committee is nominated by the House of Commons to scrutinise the Department for Transport. Its formal remit is to hold Ministers and Departments to account, and to investigate matters of public concern where there is a need for accountability to the public through Parliament.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media: <u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/submitted\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the <a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘Committee Corridor’</a>.</p>",
